  "id": "source-16591",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "16591001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "苍绿色的虚拟歌手♫",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "到处都被我们找遍了，还是没能找到能够代表「春天」的声音……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔，人迹罕至的郊外……会有我们所期待的声音吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "既然已经来了，就一起到处找找看吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯嗯，优纪都听和江的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不过呢，这里真的有好多好多的声音哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "蜜蜂的嗡嗡声，雀儿的啁啾声，还有还有——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "蝴蝶煽动翅膀的声音，风吹过树叶的沙沙声。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "原来这就是春天~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真的很动人呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯？！等一下，我听到了一个很特别的声音——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591012",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "♪哼哼……♫哼~……♬",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591013",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "Say High♫",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591014",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "对这个世界Say Hi♫",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591015",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "对这个舞台Say Fine♫",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591016",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "对我的梦想说♫\n这就是我的未来♫",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这个声音好美……真的好美……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "深有同感。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "清新，动人，充满活力，令人心生向往。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "没错没错~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这就是我们所一直寻找的能够代表「春天」的声音~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真好呢，被我们找到了！\n能够与和江一起来到这里真的太好了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江，我想……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我知道优纪在想什么，我会和你一起的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯！我们一起找到这个声音的主人吧~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591026",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "优纪、和江循着歌声的方向，一个有着苍绿色双马尾的少女闪过。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "初音未来",
          "text": "世界一直在变，但我永远用心歌唱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔哇唔哇，这首歌原来就是眼前这位少女唱的呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "没想到有着这样一副极具穿透力嗓音的歌者，竟是这样一位有些纤瘦的少女。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "原来是她，难怪会唱出如此动人的歌声。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "诶，和江认识这位少女吗？快点跟优纪介绍一下嘛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "她是一位虚拟歌手，活跃在众多领域。\n有着苍绿色双马尾的虚拟歌手，以明亮可爱的歌声演唱各种流派的歌曲。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，我确认我们找到了能够代表「春天」的声音，主人|101|一定会喜欢的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是要怎么样才能让主人|101|也听到这个声音呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "初音未来",
          "text": "戴上耳机，进入音乐的世界。Go。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16591036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "诶？！等等，你不要走呀，等等我们~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
